// `webrtc` as the repository's root entry presents it (`lib.wac` at the root) — the names other repositories import
// from it, added as each is needed. First caller: KPS (github.com/voltrevo/wac-kps), whose listener answers browsers
// on one UDP port and whose dialers are WebRTC peers themselves.
//
// **One name per statement, deliberately.** `tools/wac/libentry_test.wac` holds this file to that. `stun.wac`'s
// `parse` and `encode` are renamed with what they read and write, since nothing about a bare `parse` says STUN.

